+### 3.8 资料 profile 与文档关联风险
+
+路径：
+
+- `/data/WYC/signLanguage/work/generated/sign_data_profile/sign_data_profile.json`
+- `/data/WYC/signLanguage/work/generated/sign_data_profile/sign_data_profile.md`
